## How to Use This Workbook
This workbook can be used in several ways depending on the need.

For governance and approval:
Review the lifecycle stages and identify which risks apply to the proposed use case before onboarding or funding approval.

For delivery and implementation:
Use the relevant lifecycle tab to translate risks into specific controls, ownership actions, and design decisions.

For risk and compliance review:
Use the master register to test whether key regulatory, security, conduct, privacy, and resilience issues have been considered.

For third-party assessments:
Use the third-party, resilience, and exit sections to challenge supplier arrangements, concentration risk, contractual protections, and contingency planning.

For portfolio or interview use:
Use the workbook as evidence of structured thinking on AI governance, control design, and enterprise risk management in regulated environments.

