## Why This Matters
Generative AI can create significant business value, but it also introduces new forms of operational, conduct, security, privacy, and resilience risk.

A structured lifecycle approach helps organisations avoid treating GenAI as only a technology issue. Instead, it supports a more mature view in which GenAI is governed as a business capability with clear controls, defined ownership, and defensible oversight.

